==Swedish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sv|gmq-osw|ænkti}}, {{m|gmq-osw|ænti}}, {{m|gmq-osw|ingti}}, from a late form of the nominative neuter of {{inh|sv|gmq-osw|ængin}}. For an earlier form, see {{m|sv|icke}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈɪnˌtɛ/|lang=sv}}
* {{audio|Sv-inte.ogg|audio|lang=sv}}

===Adverb===
{{sv-adv|-}}

# [[not]]
#: ''Jag har '''inte''' gjort det.''
#:: ''I have '''not''' done that.''

====Derived terms====
* {{l|sv|jag förstår inte}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|sv|ej}}, {{l|sv|icke}}

